{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00123",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 5.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? They told me to come straight in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.64,
      "end_seconds": 9.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.58,
      "end_seconds": 15.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.82,
      "end_seconds": 18.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 19.78,
      "end_seconds": 24.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Uh, we came because of pain in my left wrist after a fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.31,
      "end_seconds": 27.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.33,
      "end_seconds": 32.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "It's been about two weeks, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.39,
      "end_seconds": 39.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.77,
      "end_seconds": 52.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "I get some relief from holding it still. Mild, I'd say. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.03,
      "end_seconds": 55.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Any swelling as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.96,
      "end_seconds": 57.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Yes, since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.75,
      "end_seconds": 62.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "What about tingling in the fingers, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.34,
      "end_seconds": 64.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.73,
      "end_seconds": 72.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Have you had pain in your left wrist after a fall before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.51,
      "end_seconds": 78.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.95,
      "end_seconds": 86.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Any deformity, loss of consciousness, pain in the shoulder or bump to the head at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.49,
      "end_seconds": 89.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.91,
      "end_seconds": 90.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "What about numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.3,
      "end_seconds": 94.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I mean, no, I haven't had any numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.17,
      "end_seconds": 99.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "So, what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.13,
      "end_seconds": 103.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.13,
      "end_seconds": 109.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 110.07,
      "end_seconds": 114.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Okay, so it's alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.46,
      "end_seconds": 117.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 118.26,
      "end_seconds": 122.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "For about three months. He takes paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.86,
      "end_seconds": 127.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Right. Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.52,
      "end_seconds": 134.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.71,
      "end_seconds": 141.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.39,
      "end_seconds": 148.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Thin bones, for nearly five years. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.51,
      "end_seconds": 156.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known thin bones. We'll keep that in mind today. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.98,
      "end_seconds": 159.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.06,
      "end_seconds": 160.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.41,
      "end_seconds": 163.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.76,
      "end_seconds": 168.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.57,
      "end_seconds": 177.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.3,
      "end_seconds": 200.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse is 64 beats a minute. And temperature is 36.7 degrees, BP is 122 over 73, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.65,
      "end_seconds": 202.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.78,
      "end_seconds": 221.98,
      "duration_seconds": 18.2,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.29,
      "end_seconds": 224.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.78,
      "end_seconds": 229.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.1,
      "end_seconds": 231.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.48,
      "end_seconds": 251.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "There's swelling and tenderness at the base of the thumb side of the wrist."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.04,
      "end_seconds": 281.86,
      "duration_seconds": 25.82,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Putting it all together, this looks most like a wrist sprain, but a small fracture is possible. I can't rule out a scaphoid fracture yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your left wrist after a fall for about two weeks, mild, and no loss of consciousness or bump to the head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.34,
      "end_seconds": 285.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.41,
      "end_seconds": 291.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Okay, is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.06,
      "end_seconds": 301.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Yes, uh, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.62,
      "end_seconds": 323.48,
      "duration_seconds": 20.86,
      "text": "I'm going to order an X-ray of the wrist, for wrist injury. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'd like you to wear a splint until the X-ray result is confirmed and keep the hand raised. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.87,
      "end_seconds": 334.32,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.74,
      "end_seconds": 337.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "So, yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.51,
      "end_seconds": 339.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Let's review you in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.66,
      "end_seconds": 344.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "So, sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.58,
      "end_seconds": 345.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.29,
      "end_seconds": 348.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.33,
      "end_seconds": 354.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}